the README, integration guide, manager guide, and\n  source-evidence ledger.\n- Document option-off as ownerless verification hardware without a product\n  image: control TX bypasses the plane, PHC controls select the CSR face,\n  publications remain zero, AVTP `tu` stays one, and publication writes are inert.\n- Keep #35 in PR #80 review and #58 open. Preserve parent #117 physical\n  acceptance and parent #64/#488 timestamp-calibration gaps. Distinguish the\n  donor's proposed calibration/tuning work from the parent's fixed corrections.\n- Add a dated forward note to the historical project status without changing\n  its archive date or original default-off account.\n\nParent evidence: `hdl/milan/milan_datapath.sv:73`,\n`docs/design/GPTP_PLANE.md:6,43-49`,\n`docs/ARCHITECTURE_HW_SW_SPLIT.md:165-175`, and `README.md:167-170`.\nThe integration guide also cites the exact TX bypass and PHC selection lines.\n\nValidation at `7cc9c492145dd9e7c5c0e1d4695a261ea8025850`:\n\n| Command or review | Result |\n| --- | --- |\n| `make -j16 docs` | rc 0 |\n| `make -j16 diagrams-check` | rc 0 |\n| `python3 scripts/check_docs.py` | rc 0; 11 current and 17 historical pages |\n| `python3 scripts/check_docs.py --selftest` | rc 0; 10 arms |\n| `python3 scripts/check_source_evidence.py` | rc 0; 20 exact anchors |\n| `python3 scripts/check_source_evidence.py --selftest` | rc 0; 7 arms |\n| `python3 scripts/generate_diagrams.py --check` | rc 0; 9 assets, 3 bound PNGs |\n| `python3 scripts/generate_diagrams.py --selftest` | rc 0; 10 arms |\n| Default-off search across current Markdown | No matches; four planted wording mutants rejected |\n| Parent citation review through git | 31 occurrences, 14 targets; four planted citation mutants rejected |\n| `git diff bd466e60 HEAD --check` | rc 0 |\n\nAll four acceptance items are met. The change contains only five Markdown\nfiles. Physical acceptance remains open under its parent issues.\n\nCloses #48\n","created_at":"2026-10-11T05:47:07Z","updated_at